 "dur": 64.0,
 "target": 64.0,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "In 1938, a pilot took off for California and landed in Ireland.",
   "s": 0.12,
   "e": 4.456
  },
  {
   "text": "Douglas Corrigan dreamed of flying across the Atlantic.",
   "s": 4.756,
   "e": 7.487
  },
  {
   "text": "He'd even helped build Lindbergh's famous plane, the Spirit of St. Louis.",
   "s": 7.787,
   "e": 11.263
  },
  {
   "text": "But officials ruled his nine-year-old plane too unsafe to try.",
   "s": 11.563,
   "e": 14.835
  },
  {
   "text": "He'd paid about three hundred dollars for it.",
   "s": 15.135,
   "e": 16.967
  },
  {
   "text": "So he filed a flight plan home to California instead.",
   "s": 17.267,
   "e": 20.111
  },
  {
   "text": "At dawn, he took off from New York, then turned east.",
   "s": 20.411,
   "e": 22.889
  },
  {
   "text": "No radio. His food: two chocolate bars and two boxes of fig bars.",
   "s": 23.189,
   "e": 27.291
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it got worse: gasoline started leaking into the cockpit.",
   "s": 27.591,
   "e": 30.473
  },
  {
   "text": "So he punched a hole in the floor with a screwdriver to drain it.",
   "s": 30.773,
   "e": 33.72
  },
  {
   "text": "For twenty-eight hours, he saw nothing but clouds and ocean.",
   "s": 34.02,
   "e": 36.706
  },
  {
   "text": "He later claimed he only looked down after twenty-six hours.",
   "s": 37.005,
   "e": 39.967
  },
  {
   "text": "Then he landed in Dublin and said: \"Where am I? I intended to fly to California.\"",
   "s": 40.267,
   "e": 44.623
  },
  {
   "text": "His excuse? Fog, and he followed the wrong end of his compass needle.",
   "s": 44.803,
   "e": 48.204
  },
  {
   "text": "Nobody believed him. But America loved it.",
   "s": 48.504,
   "e": 50.741
  },
  {
   "text": "New York threw him a ticker-tape parade bigger than Lindbergh's.",
   "s": 51.041,
   "e": 53.922
  },
  {
   "text": "His punishment: a fourteen-day suspension. Exactly as long as his boat ride home.",
   "s": 54.222,
   "e": 58.989
  },
  {
   "text": "Until he died, he swore he was flying to California.",
   "s": 59.289,
   "e": 61.976
  }
 ],
